{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "06670a47-0956-4d04-9637-f783c82ad5fa",
    "name": "Restful Booker API Testing",
    "description": "This collection covers end-to-end API testing for the **Restful Booker** API — a practice booking system available at `https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com`.\n\nIt includes requests that exercise the core booking lifecycle:\n\n- **Authentication** — Generate an auth token via the `/auth` endpoint, required for protected operations.\n- **Create Booking** — Submit new hotel bookings using `POST /booking`.\n- **Retrieve Bookings** — Fetch a list of all booking IDs with `GET /booking`, and retrieve details for a specific booking by ID.\n- **Update Booking** — Modify an existing booking's details using `PUT /booking/:id`.\n- **Error Handling** — Validate API behaviour for invalid inputs, such as requesting a booking with a non-existent ID (expected `404` response).\n\nUse this collection to validate that the Restful Booker API handles standard CRUD operations correctly, enforces authentication where required, and returns appropriate error responses for edge cases.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "55576130",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/55576130-06670a47-0956-4d04-9637-f783c82ad5fa?source=collection_link"
  },
